  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr900.html",
  "prefLabel": "Agr 904.10 Bulk Maple Syrup",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 904.10 Bulk Maple Syrup.\n\n(a) Bulk maple syrup sold directly to consumers, restaurants, or any other market where the syrup is not further processed before purchase by the consumer shall meet the same density standards as packaged maple syrup set forth in Agr 904.04.\n\n(b) Bulk maple syrup sold directly to consumers, restaurants, or any other market where the syrup is not further processed before purchase by the consumer shall be labeled with the same information required by RSA 429:14.\n\n(c) When the density of bulk maple syrup does not fall within the range set forth in Agr 904.04, the container shall be clearly marked “Notice- The syrup contained herein fails to meet state density standards. The density is ____ points Baume at 60 degrees Fahrenheit.” The accurate density for the syrup within the bulk container shall be stated.\n\nSource. #10744, eff 12-16-14; ss by #14225, eff 3-29-25 (formerly Agr 904.09)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr900.html"
